0..57 Comment "// A role states what it needs of the site that hosts it."
58..60 Comment "//"
61..134 Comment "// The requirement travels with the program, and the offer stays with the"
135..210 Comment "// site. A deployment that pairs them wrongly is refused before any process"
211..221 Comment "// starts."
222..224 Comment "//"
225..300 Comment "// `far` requires `Store`, so a site that hosts `far` must offer a model of"
301..378 Comment "// `Store`, member for member. `gandr check` of the manifold packs the site\'s"
379..429 Comment "// `Offers` at `Model(Store)` and judges the pack."
